 "stimulus_html": "Compute the entropy of the following discrete random variables.",
 "questions": [
  {
   "id": 510771,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "The distribution <i>X</i> whose values are given in the following table.<br>\n<table>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td align=\"center\"><span data-math=\"X\"></span></td>\n<td align=\"center\">1</td>\n<td align=\"center\">2</td>\n<td align=\"center\">3</td>\n<td align=\"center\">4</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\"><span data-math=\"p(x)\"></span></td>\n<td align=\"center\">0.7</td>\n<td align=\"center\">0.15</td>\n<td align=\"center\">0.05</td>\n<td align=\"center\">0.05</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody><caption>Distribution <i>X</i> Values</caption>\n</table>",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<span data-math=\"H{(X)}=-{(0.7{\\text{log}}_20.7+0.15{\\text{log}}_20.15+0.05{\\text{log}}_20.05+0.05{\\text{log}}_20.05)}=1.203\"></span>"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "1.203"
    }
   ],
   "community_solutions": []
  },
  {
   "id": 510772,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "The binomial distribution with <span data-math=\"p=1/3\"></span> and <span data-math=\"n=4\"></span>. Recall, the binomial distribution is defined by:<br>\n<span data-math=\"P{(x)}=\\begin{pmatrix}n\\\\x\\end{pmatrix}p^x{(1-p)}^{n-x}\"></span>",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "First use the binomial distribution formula to find the probabilities. With <span data-math=\"p=1/3\"></span> and <span data-math=\"n=4\"></span>, we have:<br>\n<span data-math=\"P{(x)}={(\\begin{array}{c}4\\\\x\\end{array})}{(\\frac13)}^x{(\\frac23)}^{4-x}\"></span><br>\n<span data-math=\"P{(0)}={(\\begin{array}{c}4\\\\0\\end{array})}{(\\frac13)}^0{(\\frac23)}^4=0.198\"></span>, <span data-math=\"P{(1)}={(\\begin{array}{c}4\\\\1\\end{array})}{(\\frac13)}^1{(\\frac23)}^3=0.395\"></span>, <span data-math=\"P{(2)}={(\\begin{array}{c}4\\\\2\\end{array})}{(\\frac13)}^2{(\\frac23)}^2=0.296\"></span>,<br>\n<span data-math=\"P{(3)}={(\\begin{array}{c}4\\\\3\\end{array})}{(\\frac13)}^3{(\\frac23)}^1=0.099\"></span>, <span data-math=\"P{(4)}={(\\begin{array}{c}4\\\\4\\end{array})}{(\\frac13)}^4{(\\frac23)}^0=0.012\"></span><br>\n<span data-math=\"H{(P)}=-{(0.198{\\text{log}}_20.198+0.395{\\text{log}}_20.395+0.296{\\text{log}}_20.296+0.099{\\text{log}}_20.099+0.012{\\text{log}}_20.012)}=1.919\"></span>"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "1.919"
    }
   ],
   "community_solutions": []
  }
 ],
